=The daily heartbeat found workflows that are deactivated or silent:

{{ $('Find Heartbeat Problems').all().map(i => '- ' + i.json.name + ' (' + i.json.workflow_id + '): ' + i.json.problem).join('\n') }}

An inactive workflow sends NO error emails — that is exactly why this check exists (see the 2026-07-01 Sign Link incident). Open n8n, check the workflow, and re-publish/fix as needed. Logged to pipeline_errors with phase 'heartbeat'.
